xpert ratings are available yet for this race, so the forecast rests on Georgia's recent margins and fundamentals. That points to a razor-thin Republican edge, well within the range where turnout, the national environment, or the eventual nominees could flip the state. Headlines so far center on Democratic primary speculation rather than the general-election matchup, leaving the picture unsettled.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.4567, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.4683, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.467, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.4627, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.4625, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.4617, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.4629, "margin": -1.0}]}